      "id": 495267,
      "username": "tcbinfotech",
      "name": "TCB Infotech",
      "created_at": "2026-03-02T03:19:43.125Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is a permissions issue. frappe.db.get_list() silently drops fields the current user doesn’t have permission to read no error is thrown, the fields are just omitted.</p>\n<p>use ignore_permissions=True in Python server-side, or create a whitelisted <span class=\"mention\">@frappe.whitelist</span>() method and call it from JS via frappe.call().</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/tcbinfotech/{size}/93928_2.png",
